<h2>3. Database Models for Cloud / Cortex Migration</h2>

<h3>Table: users</h3>
<pre>CREATE TABLE users (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  phone VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
  name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
  email VARCHAR(150),
  avatar_url TEXT,
  avatar_preset VARCHAR(50),
  jersey_number INTEGER CHECK (jersey_number BETWEEN 1 AND 99),
  rating NUMERIC(3, 1) DEFAULT 4.5,
  overall_rating INTEGER DEFAULT 75,
  primary_position VARCHAR(10) CHECK (primary_position IN ('GK', 'DEF', 'MID', 'FWD')),
  specific_position VARCHAR(10),
  preferred_foot VARCHAR(10) DEFAULT 'Right',
  matches_played INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  goals INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  assists INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  clean_sheets INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  mvp_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT NOW()
);</pre>

<h3>Table: rooms</h3>
<pre>CREATE TABLE rooms (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  room_code VARCHAR(6) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
  host_id UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  co_organizer_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
  title VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
  venue_name VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
  format VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT '7v7',
  num_teams INTEGER DEFAULT 2,
  players_per_team INTEGER DEFAULT 7,
  goal_target INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  status VARCHAR(30) DEFAULT 'LOBBY',
  revision INTEGER DEFAULT 1,
  created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT NOW()
);</pre>

<h3>Table: matches</h3>
<pre>CREATE TABLE matches (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  room_id UUID REFERENCES rooms(id),
  title VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
  venue_name VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
  format VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT '7v7',
  surface VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'Artificial Turf',
  date DATE NOT NULL,
  team_a_name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
  team_b_name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
  team_a_score INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  team_b_score INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  duration_minutes INTEGER DEFAULT 50,
  mvp_user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
  status VARCHAR(30) DEFAULT 'UPCOMING',
  created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT NOW()
);</pre>

<h2>4. Cloud & Cortex Migration Roadmap</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> Replace mock phone auth in <code>src/store/AuthContext.tsx</code> with cloud JWT authentication (Twilio Verify / Firebase / Cortex Auth).</li>
  <li><strong>Real-time Sockets:</strong> Replace <code>BroadcastChannel</code> in <code>src/services/roomService.ts</code> and <code>src/services/multiplayerSyncService.ts</code> with WebSocket / Socket.IO connection pools.</li>
  <li><strong>Media Storage:</strong> Route <code>src/utils/imagePicker.ts</code> uploads through pre-signed S3 / Cloud Storage URLs and store the CDN URL in <code>users.avatar_url</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Draft Conflict Locking:</strong> Implement optimistic locking (using room <code>revision</code>) in <code>src/screens/teams/PlayerDraftScreen.tsx</code> so simultaneous taps by captains are validated atomically by the cloud database.</li>
</ol>

